            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.hpp",
                    "line": 35,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "Can't these just all be private since nobody should be deriving anything from this class?\n\nAlso, how about grouping all of the public members/methods all in one spot?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/entity_manager.hpp",
                    "line": 35,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "I mark them `protected` for testing purpose. That way we can have a test class inherit from it.\n\nI am somewhat wary of changing the order of the member variables too much because the initialization order will be different as well.\n\nhttps://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/initializer_list.html"
                }
            ],
